2.1.1.2 Stopping criterion
The network is trained on a training dataset Dtrain. But the aim is to have the best generalization over unseen data. To this end, the original dataset D is generally split into three sub-datasets: Dtrain, Dvalidation and Dtest. The model weights are updated to minimize the

