2.1.3.5 Hardware limitations
Deep Neural Networks are trained with computers, leading to some limitations. Computation time for forward and backward passes are dependent on the hardware used. Modern frameworks (Tensorﬂow, Pytorch) provide highly optimized algorithms for commonly used operations, notably on Graphic Processing Unit (GPU). Nonetheless, as networks get deeper

