2.5.1.1 RIMES
RIMES (Recognition and Indexing of handwritten documents and faxes) is a project funded by the French ministries of defense and research. Its goal was to create a new dataset of mixed (handwritten and typed) documents, dedicated to varied tasks representative of industrial applications. The idea was to cover the following tasks: layout analysis, handwriting recognition, information extraction, writer identiﬁcation and logo identiﬁcation.

